{"asset_key":"ep4/herohub_story_14411270","episode":"ep4","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"14411270","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1441127001:0":{"text":"サリエ……様が私を地上に行かせた目的は、「真相」の真偽を確かめるため、ではないだろうか。","source_cn":"沙利叶让我前往地表的目的，或许是为了验证我说出口的“真相”。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BDD35C411A6CAC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1441127002:0":{"text":"私が厄化せずに戻ってこられれば、呪いは消え、地上の世界が女王の言うとおりではないことの証明になる。","source_cn":"我能够没有孽化迹象地回来，就向世人证明了我的诅咒已经解...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D819960800A74FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1441127003:0":{"text":"本当なら、太陽の下で自由に暮らし、風や雨をこの身に感じられたはずだと証明できる……","source_cn":"——证明我们本可以自由地生活在阳光下，沐浴微风和雨露。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x365B1195E5E087A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1441127004:0":{"text":"今こそ……エクシルの血に刻まれた呪いを断ち切る時だ。","source_cn":"艾塞勒血脉中延续千年的诅咒……到了挣脱的时候了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98FB005B9D515235","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:因度厄":{"text":"インドラ","source":"因度厄","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}